<Base title="About" description="Who we are and how to find Willow Lane Books in Bath.">
  <h1>About the shop</h1>
  <p>We opened on Willow Lane in 2014 with two shelves of second-hand paperbacks. Today there are three rooms: new books at the front, children's books in the middle and second-hand at the back.</p>
  <h2>Finding us</h2>
  <p>12 Willow Lane, Bath. Five minutes' walk from the station, opposite the bakery.</p>
  <h2>Opening hours</h2>
  <p>Tuesday to Saturday, 9am to 5:30pm. Closed Sunday and Monday.</p>
</Base>
